# Copy this file to `.env` and drop your own token in there.
# Free, instant, no card: https://aqicn.org/data-platform/token/
#
# Put the real key in `.env`, never in this file — `.env` is gitignored,
# this template is committed.
#
# No VITE_ prefix on purpose: the token is read only by the /api/waqi proxy
# (api/waqi.js) and never compiled into the browser bundle.
#
# Without a token the proxy falls back to WAQI's shared "demo" token, which
# ignores the requested location and always returns one fixed sample station.
# The UI renders correctly on it, but city search won't find the visitor's city.
WAQI_TOKEN=your_waqi_token_here
